f 0.18. v2.3.0 is the most recent production release marked healthy.\n- **Current state:** After the rollback, checkout-api reports healthy in all regions with an error rate of 0.002.\n- **Approval:** The rollback response shows a human approval (\"Approved. Looks right.\").\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the current state. It also notes that v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until someone finds the root cause.", "type": "text"}]}]}